stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Open: MP1 capture lands with host_is_primary false
    Open --> FetchAttempted: MP2 re-checker fetches from the primary host
    FetchAttempted --> HostRefused: MP3 the primary host refuses or returns nothing
    HostRefused --> FetchAttempted: MP4 retry with a different tool or header set
    HostRefused --> Open: MP5 attempts exhausted - task stays open and is reported
    FetchAttempted --> PulledMatch: MP6 primary bytes hash-match the mirror
    FetchAttempted --> PulledDiffers: MP7 primary bytes differ from the mirror
    PulledMatch --> Closed: MP8 qualifier cleared by L9 on the row and its dependants
    PulledDiffers --> Regrading: MP9 every difference listed and every citation flagged
    Regrading --> Closed: MP10 row re-graded against the primary text

    note right of PulledMatch
        A match clears provenance only.
        An open date question stays open,
        as with 13 or 14 May for EV-058.
    end note

    note right of Open
        Engine use is allowed, flagged.
        Customer-facing use is barred
        until the pull closes.
    end note
